@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] tooling-pinned-upstream
Contract tooling MUST use the exact upstream cc-check version in package.json and
its committed npm lockfile. A missing installation MUST fail with a setup command;
verification MUST NOT silently download a different tool or skip checking.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:architecture] tooling-development-only
The Node contract checker and its dependencies MUST remain development tooling;
Marshall, Lilly and protocol production releases MUST NOT depend on them at runtime.
